WEBVTT

00:00:00.218 --> 00:00:05.869
Enquiry follow-ups

00:00:05.919 --> 00:00:08.758
Find the family you need to call back.

00:00:19.763 --> 00:00:22.197
Press Edit to open the enquiry.

00:00:25.242 --> 00:00:28.830
Pick the next follow-up date and write what was discussed.

00:00:39.728 --> 00:00:46.396
Press Update Enquiry. The date now shows in the Follow-up column, red once it is overdue.

00:00:50.528 --> 00:00:55.200
Follow-up scheduled
